{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"yuanzhang-e-o048","title":"时有投书诽谤者，太祖疾之欲必知其主，国渊请留其本书而不宣露","accounts":[{"id":"yuanzhang-a-8980bdd730de2054c626","label":"正文","text":"时有投书诽谤者，太祖疾之欲必知其主，国渊请留其本书而不宣露","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-771d6f637a8d1d16e86f"]},{"id":"yuanzhang-a-c30f46d4a192b19fc7fa","label":"正文","text":"投书多引《二京赋》，国渊敕功曹简开解年少以求能读者，旬日得能读者遂往受业","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-e7afa1d50e76c4a6a502"]},{"id":"yuanzhang-a-3895806cc453793ffc53","label":"正文","text":"吏请能读者作笺，比方其书与投书人同手，收摄案问具得情理","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-a8320eb18e17728136b0"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"疾投书诽谤，欲必知其主","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-771d6f637a8d1d16e86f"]},{"person":"wendi-p0054","role":"请留其本书，而不宣露；敕功曹简开解年少欲遣就师，训以可求能读《二京赋》者从受之，又密喻旨，旬日得能读者；属吏请能读者作笺，比方其书与投书人同手，收摄案问，具得情理","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-771d6f637a8d1d16e86f","yuanzhang-q-e7afa1d50e76c4a6a502","yuanzhang-q-a8320eb18e17728136b0"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-771d6f637a8d1d16e86f","yuanzhang-q-e7afa1d50e76c4a6a502","yuanzhang-q-a8320eb18e17728136b0"]},"ordering_evidence":"yuanzhang-q-771d6f637a8d1d16e86f","source_order":[11,152,6],"order":2573}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0054","name":"国渊","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"yuanzhang-q-771d6f637a8d1d16e86f","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-f9a3efdd1dfb243961ed","layer":"original","quote":"时有投书诽谤者〖1〗，太祖疾之，欲必知其主。渊请留其本书，而不宣露","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":151,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":6,"end":39,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-a8320eb18e17728136b0","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-f9a3efdd1dfb243961ed","layer":"original","quote":"吏因请使作笺〖10〗；比方其书〖11〗，与投书人同手〖12〗。收摄案问〖13〗，具得情理","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":151,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":179,"end":223,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-e7afa1d50e76c4a6a502","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-f9a3efdd1dfb243961ed","layer":"original","quote":"其书多引《二京赋》〖2〗。渊敕功曹曰：“此郡既大，今在都辇〖3〗，而少学问者〖4〗；其简开解年少〖5〗，欲遣就师〖6〗。”功曹差三人，临遣，引见。训以“所学未及〖7〗；《二京赋》，博物之书也〖8〗；世人忽略，少有其师，可求能读者从受之”。又密喻旨〖9〗。旬日得能读者，遂往受业","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":151,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":40,"end":178,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
